{
  "lessonId": "03-stack-queue-stack-01",
  "title": "栈的后进先出规则",
  "objectives": [
    "理解栈顶与栈底的含义",
    "能够用后进先出判断出栈顺序"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "role": "teacher",
      "contentRef": "03-stack-queue/stack/slide-01",
      "animationRef": "stack-push-pop"
    },
    {
      "type": "question",
      "role": "teacher",
      "prompt": "依次将 A、B、C 入栈后，第一次出栈的元素是什么？",
      "expected": ["C"],
      "misconceptions": ["A", "B"],
      "misconceptionFeedback": {
        "A": "A 最早入栈，不能先出栈。请沿着栈顶重新观察。",
        "B": "B 位于 A 与 C 之间，C 仍在它的上方。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "请比较 C 的入栈时间和它到达栈顶的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "blackboard",
      "role": "teacher",
      "content": "push 和 pop 都发生在同一端，因此栈满足后进先出。",
      "animationRef": "stack-push-pop"
    },
    {
      "type": "summary",
      "role": "teacher",
      "content": "栈只从栈顶插入和删除，最后进入的元素最先离开。"
    }
  ]
}
